				(field
					(name "LCSC") "C207091")
				(field
					(name "Note") "RGB strip common: 5 A hold / 10 A trip at 20 C, 16 V, R1max 25 mOhm. Littelfuse 2920L derating (reference data): hold 4.15 A at 40 C, 3.75 A at 50 C, 3.30 A at 60 C (the conservative of the two review sets; the Littelfuse 2920L table reads 4.25 / 3.88 / 3.50 A) -> firmware RGB cap 3.3 A RMS at <= 50 C local ambient (owner can raise it in firmware; coordinator QA A9 2026-10-27). Coordination (power review P4): a hard short is limited by the LPV-60-5 hiccup (8.8-12 A) before F1 trips; F1 covers sustained overloads between hold and the supply limit (owner decision O2 open). Not upsized (a bigger PTC worsens that coordination); the stock board feeds the strips unprotected")
