				(field
					(name "Note") "logic / audio / sensor / USB rail. Current limit 2.8-3.2 A (RILM 680R: 2030 A.Ohm / RILM per the SLVSE57C 7.5 table points 487R -> 4.17 A, 1780R -> 1.17 A). Over-voltage: +5V_SYS follows +5V_IN up to the OV threshold VOVC 5.5-5.9 V and is clamped to 5.2-5.7 V above it (SLVSE57C p.7), so under a supply fault +5V_SYS can reach 5.9 V: above the 5.5 V recommended maximum of the TLV62569 / MAX98357A, under their 6.0 V absolute maximum (coordinator QA A9 2026-10-27; was '<= 5.7 V')")
