				(value "ref L1: digital 3V3 -> 3V3A. JLC BASIC bead 600 R at 100 MHz, 500 mA, 0.3 R (WIZnet note g: 100-2000 R is adequate; W5500 total 132 mA -> <= 40 mV drop). Swapped from the extended Murata BLM18PG221SN1D (cost pass 2026-10-26)")
