				(field
					(name "Note") "vertical (top-entry) 16-pin USB 2.0 receptacle (owner 2026-10-26), HRO TYPE-C-31-D-15 (8.8 mm tall; drawing datasheets/dl/j10/C22464480.pdf, 2023-10-27): 4 shell legs 0.90 x 0.30 x 2.20 +-0.25 pass the 1.6 mm board (real THT joint; coordinator QA D1 2026-10-27, DECISIONS #11 - the D-06 legs stopped inside the slots). JLC has no LCSC footprint for C22464480 (EasyEDA API 404): CPL confirm-in-preview row. Device / sink: VBUS_DBG powers nothing on the board (no back-feed); the CH340N runs from +3V3, so the port enumerates while the board is powered")
